# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository for every text file,
# regardless of what a given checkout's core.autocrlf is set to - this
# project deploys to Linux (Docker on the VPS), so LF is the one that
# actually matters; a Windows checkout can still show CRLF locally without
# that ever touching what's committed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Known binary types - never touched by line-ending normalization, listed
# explicitly so a future file of these types doesn't depend on Git's
# content-sniffing guessing right.
*.png   binary
*.woff2 binary
*.gz    binary
*.zip   binary
